<title>USA: Firstar Corp Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Firstar Corp Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>MILWAUKEE, Wis. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.98		    $0.95</p>
<p> Net			 73,624		   71,769</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  75,187		   74,623</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Operating income excluding special items for the Q4 1996 was $72.1 million or $0.96 a share. Operating income for Q4 1995 was $0.95 a share.  </p>
<p>		     Year</p>
<p> Shr			  $3.37		    $3.00</p>
<p> Net			250,177		  228,913</p>
<p> Avg shrs		  74,031		   75,716</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers) Assets: $19.77 billion versus $19.17 billion Loans: $13.20 billion versus $12.63 billion Deposits: $15.21 billion versus $14.31 billion</p>
<p>NOTE: In 1996, Firstar incurred total net special charges of $33.4 million after taxes, or $0.45 a share. In 1995 Firstar incurred special acquisition-related charges of $0.36 a share.</p>
<p>((--Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
